.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-server-ip-list - List the server's IPv4 addresses


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro server ip list  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List the server's IPv4 addresses

.PP
Additional IPv4 addresses are billed per address hourly from the prepaid balance (default 2 EUR per address-month, \fBpricing\fR shows the current price), from the hour they are added until they are released. Up to \fBmax\fR per server (default 5). Each address is configured on the server automatically (/32 on the primary interface, kept across reboots and reinstalls); reverse DNS: PUT /cloud/servers/{id}/rdns.

.PP
API: GET /cloud/servers/{id}/ips (operationId listServerIps, scope cloud_read)


